				<r3d:description language="eng">The most comprehensive database on fully determined inorganic crystal structures
• Full structural data: cell parameters, atom positions for all entries, displacement parameters
• Full bibliographic data: publication title, journal reference(s), author names
• Full structure description: Structural formula, compositions, ANX formulae, structure types
• High-quality data: extensive data evaluation and correction by senior experts
• Web and PC based software solutions, data updated twice a year
• 25+ years of serving the scientific community</r3d:description>
